          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP336 Porters Hill, 740m

There is an easier way to access this cap if you stay high and walk around. I went for the direct route, down the coulee and up the other side. Nice cap with a great view.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
